<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crīnālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		crinis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to the hair,
				hair-</i> (<b>poet.</b>, or in post-Aug.
			prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 403</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 4, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 617</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 576</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Stat. Achill. 2, 97</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acus,</span>”
				<i>a hair-pin</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 207, 4</span></i>
			; for which <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crīnāle</span></b> , is,
				n., <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5, 53</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dentes,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of a hair-comb</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. B. Gild. 137</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpore polypus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>furnished with hair-like feelers</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Hal.
					30</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 29, 46, § 86</span></i> (s. v.
			crinis, II. B.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
